  1	# Phase 7: Deferred Extension Polish
  2	
  3	## Summary
  4	
  5	Complete the deferred items from Phase 6 and prior phases: session persistence on reload, peer status polling, queue tab indicators, approval routing optimization, meta-session rename, and platform quota overlay.
  6	
  7	**Prerequisite:** Phase 6 (dual-tab), Phase 5D (review modal), Phase 5E (diff viewer) all complete.
